  "description": "<h1>Eternal Insurance</h1>\n<p>This mod increases the <strong>MAX STORAGE TIME</strong> to <em>999 days</em> (or <em>86313600 seconds</em> to be precise) for the insurance return dialog that holds items for you. Applies to every trader.</p>\n<p>Please be advised that this <strong>UPDATES EXISTING PROFILE FILES</strong>.</p>\n<p>You can manually update storage time in seconds by changing the value in <code>Config/config.json</code>.</p>\n",
